OL,3,GNEWSAFamily wins high court bid over
OL,4,Afatal club stabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a man stabbed in a
OL,7,Fnightclub in 2017 have welcomed a High
OL,8,FCourt ruling that could lead to the
OL,9,Fcircumstances of his death being
OL,10,Fre-examined.
OL,12,FRyan Passey's family have been granted
OL,13,Fpermission to challenge a decision made
OL,14,Fby the Director of Public Prosecutions
OL,15,Fnot to apply to the Court of Appeal to
OL,16,Fconsider overturning the acquittal of a
OL,17,Fman in connection with the killing.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
